@startuml
title Doggy's - Mapa de componentes

skinparam componentStyle rectangle


actor Cliente

component "Frontend\nDoggy's" as Frontend
component "API Gateway" as Gateway
component "Auth Service" as Auth
component "HashiCorp Vault" as Vault

component "GraphQL Gateway\nPrivado" as GraphQL

component "Clients Service\n:9101" as Clients
component "Inventory Service\n:9102" as Inventory
component "Orders Service\n:9103" as Orders
component "Payments Service\n:9104" as Payments

database "MongoDB" as Mongo


Cliente --> Frontend

Frontend --> Gateway : HTTPS / REST / GraphQL

Gateway --> Auth : autenticación
Gateway --> Vault : secretos

Gateway --> Clients : REST
Gateway --> Inventory : REST
Gateway --> Orders : REST
Gateway --> Payments : REST

Gateway --> GraphQL : consulta agregada

GraphQL --> Orders : REST
GraphQL --> Inventory : REST

Orders --> Inventory : validar producto,\nstock y precio

Payments --> Orders : consultar pedido\nactualizar estado

Clients --> Mongo
Inventory --> Mongo
Orders --> Mongo
Payments --> Mongo


note right of GraphQL
Servicio privado.
No posee autoridad
sobre datos de negocio.
end note

note bottom of Gateway
Único punto de entrada
público hacia los
servicios internos.
end note

@enduml